OL,3,GNEWSAWaterpark makes a splash as it is
OL,4,Anamed UK's best
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major tourism attraction has been
OL,7,Fnamed the UK's best waterpark during a
OL,8,Flandmark year in its history.
OL,10,FBlackpool's Sandcastle Waterpark has
OL,11,Fwon Waterpark of the Year at the UK
OL,12,FTheme Park Awards as it celebrates its
OL,13,F40th birthday. The accolade comes
OL,14,Fduring a year of investment at the
OL,15,Fvenue.
OL,17,FThe awards celebrates excellence across
OL,18,Fthe attractions industry, recognising
OL,19,Fthe UK's best rides, parks and visitor
OL,20,Fexperiences as voted for by the public
OL,21,Fand industry experts.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
